# Dependencies
node_modules/
# package-lock.json is intentionally committed (not ignored) - it pins the
# exact dependency tree so every install (local, CI, Vercel) resolves the
# same versions, and gives `npm ci`/lockfile-integrity checks something to
# verify against.
yarn.lock

